WEBVTT

00:05.250 --> 00:06.580
<b>I'm sorry, Bell...</b>

00:07.790 --> 00:10.750
<b>For making you waste valuable Mind to start a fire.</b>

00:11.210 --> 00:13.630
<b>It's okay. Something small like that doesn't take much.</b>

00:15.130 --> 00:17.580
<b>We haven't seen a monster in a while...</b>

00:18.040 --> 00:20.580
<b>You're right. I don't sense any nearby.</b>

00:20.710 --> 00:23.000
<b>It doesn't feel like we're being watched,
and I don't hear breathing.</b>

00:23.380 --> 00:25.630
<b>Perhaps they don't spawn in this room.</b>

00:26.960 --> 00:31.330
<b>Um, I should be the one to apologize...</b>

00:31.710 --> 00:32.710
<b>For what?</b>

00:33.130 --> 00:37.380
<b>For getting you all wet when I passed out in the river...</b>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<b>You needn't worry about it.</b>

00:41.710 --> 00:46.750
<b>Right now, we need to focus on getting
these wet clothes off and warming ourselves up.</b>

00:47.880 --> 00:54.210
<b>Given our current state of exhaustion, it could be fatal for
us to let our body temperatures drop too low.</b>

00:54.420 --> 00:55.630
<b>R-right.</b>

00:56.670 --> 00:59.670
<b>Th-this whole situation is extremely uncomfortable...</b>

01:00.250 --> 01:03.630
<b>I can't believe we're nearly naked
in the middle of the Dungeon...</b>

01:04.040 --> 01:05.460
<b>H-here you go...</b>

01:07.040 --> 01:08.830
<b>No, you should keep it.</b>

01:09.040 --> 01:10.380
<b>But it's yours, Miss Ryu.</b>

01:10.380 --> 01:12.580
<b>You need to let your body heal.</b>

01:13.170 --> 01:14.040
<b>I can't use it!</b>

01:14.290 --> 01:15.420
<b>But I'd rather you-</b>

01:21.080 --> 01:24.000
<b>Don't worry. My eyes are closed.</b>

01:25.710 --> 01:27.000
<b>Thank you...</b>

01:30.830 --> 01:31.540
<b>No problem...</b>

01:45.670 --> 01:49.540
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

03:04.880 --> 03:09.080
<b>Daydream</b>

03:04.880 --> 03:09.080
<b>A Sweet Lie</b>

03:14.750 --> 03:15.750
<b>I don't understand.</b>

03:17.080 --> 03:19.960
<b>I feel unusually aware of his presence...</b>

03:21.710 --> 03:25.710
<b>It wasn't even this bad when he spied
on us in the bath that one time...</b>

03:27.290 --> 03:28.500
<b>S-sorry!</b>

03:28.500 --> 03:31.880
<b>It's fine. I'm the one who should apologize.</b>

03:32.460 --> 03:34.880
<b>This is neither the time nor place to feel embarrassed...</b>

03:37.380 --> 03:40.420
<b>That's right. We can't afford to get distracted right now.</b>

03:41.210 --> 03:44.630
<b>Bell, I need you to be completely honest
with me about something.</b>

03:45.000 --> 03:47.380
<b>Uh, sure. What is it?</b>

03:47.710 --> 03:51.330
<b>Why did you come back for me? At the Colosseum.</b>

03:52.710 --> 03:54.170
<b>One wrong step, and-</b>

03:54.540 --> 03:57.380
<b>No, even in the perfect scenario,
we both could have died.</b>

03:58.710 --> 04:02.880
<b>Did you know that this room was under the Colosseum?</b>

04:03.130 --> 04:03.830
<b>No...</b>

04:04.670 --> 04:06.750
<b>Then why did you do it?</b>

04:09.130 --> 04:12.880
<b>"I can't let anyone else die."
That was my thought process.</b>

04:14.420 --> 04:16.040
<b>He's telling the truth...</b>

04:16.540 --> 04:22.250
<b>It wasn't calculated. There was no ulterior motive.
His goal was to save my life, nothing more...</b>

04:23.830 --> 04:24.580
<b>Bell...</b>

04:25.540 --> 04:28.170
<b>Can I tell you the story?</b>

04:28.460 --> 04:29.080
<b>Huh?</b>

04:29.710 --> 04:34.380
<b>Of what happened to us, the Astrea Familia,
on that fateful day?</b>

04:34.960 --> 04:37.290
<b>I'd really like you to know.</b>

04:39.250 --> 04:39.920
<b>Of course.</b>

04:44.540 --> 04:47.000
<b>And... that's how it ended.</b>

04:47.290 --> 04:48.960
<b>That man, the tamer...</b>

04:49.670 --> 04:51.960
<b>What Jura said about "slaughtering all my friends"...</b>

04:53.210 --> 04:59.040
<b>My life was spared in exchange
for the lives of my Familia...</b>

05:00.790 --> 05:03.580
<b>So... That's why I...</b>

05:04.420 --> 05:07.670
<b>Well then... I guess you've got
to go on without them, huh?</b>

05:09.460 --> 05:14.750
<b>They were important to you, and they fought hard
because they wanted you to survive.</b>

05:16.630 --> 05:18.290
<b>Even a dummy like me can see that.</b>

05:18.880 --> 05:21.250
<b>If you were to die now, Miss Ryu...</b>

05:21.580 --> 05:24.000
<b>I bet Miss Alise and the rest
of your friends would be mad.</b>

05:25.960 --> 05:27.380
<b>My chest feels warm...</b>

05:28.170 --> 05:31.000
<b>But my body feels icy cold...</b>

05:33.380 --> 05:34.920
<b>B-Bell...</b>

05:36.710 --> 05:37.290
<b>Yes?</b>

05:37.750 --> 05:42.250
<b>I-I think we ought to consider... skin-to-skin contact.</b>

05:42.750 --> 05:44.880
<b>Wh-what?!</b>

05:45.420 --> 05:50.750
<b>W-well, our current method is proving to be i-ineffective.</b>

05:50.750 --> 05:54.750
<b>S-so if you really want the both
of us to make it home, then...</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:58.000
<b>...we need to increase our body heat
by huddling close together!</b>

05:59.880 --> 06:01.500
<b>Now's not the time to be shy.</b>

06:01.790 --> 06:05.540
<b>Hurry, before it's too late... Before we freeze to death!</b>

06:05.540 --> 06:09.330
<b>B-but... you're an Elf, Miss Ryu... and, um...</b>

06:09.710 --> 06:11.630
<b>You needn't worry about that.</b>

06:12.170 --> 06:15.790
<b>If it's an emergency, us Elves would
do anything! I'd even hug a Dwarf!</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:17.670
<b>Wait, really?!</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:22.710
<b>Probably...</b>

06:23.710 --> 06:24.420
<b>Ah...</b>

06:26.460 --> 06:28.250
<b>B-but Bell...</b>

06:28.960 --> 06:34.250
<b>You, um... have to promise not to...
have any indecent thoughts.</b>

06:34.880 --> 06:35.710
<b>Come again?</b>

06:36.290 --> 06:39.830
<b>Because if you do, I might accidentally slap you...</b>

06:39.830 --> 06:43.080
<b>O-or, um, punch your lights out...</b>

06:45.250 --> 06:49.670
<b>Th-that's not to say I think you'd be attracted to a body
like mine...</b>

06:49.670 --> 06:52.960
<b>I-it's just, er... W-well, I...</b>

06:55.830 --> 06:56.710
<b>Huh?</b>

06:59.540 --> 07:00.170
<b>Ouch...</b>

07:00.170 --> 07:02.250
<b>What's so funny?!</b>

07:02.250 --> 07:05.210
<b>Sorry! I'm a little relieved, is all.</b>

07:05.880 --> 07:07.750
<b>You haven't changed a bit, Miss Ryu.</b>

07:08.790 --> 07:11.790
<b>Uh, so then... how should we do this?</b>

07:12.290 --> 07:17.460
<b>Hugging each other might be kind of awkward
since we're not wearing any clothes, and... um...</b>

07:18.920 --> 07:19.580
<b>Huh?</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:23.750
<b>That's... fine by me.</b>

07:42.500 --> 07:44.540
<b>Are you warm now?</b>

07:49.880 --> 07:51.960
<b>Yes, very...</b>

07:52.330 --> 07:53.290
<b>Good.</b>

07:53.630 --> 07:54.380
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:02.670 --> 08:04.000
<b>Miss Ryu, you're...</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:09.750
<b>I guess I never realized how small you are.</b>

08:10.210 --> 08:13.790
<b>I don't think I'm that much shorter than you.</b>

08:13.790 --> 08:17.080
<b>Oh, uh, I know... That's not what I meant.</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:18.420
<b>What did you mean?</b>

08:19.130 --> 08:20.500
<b>Actually, never mind.</b>

08:20.790 --> 08:21.790
<b>No, tell me.</b>

08:21.960 --> 08:23.170
<b>B-but...</b>

08:23.170 --> 08:24.080
<b>Spit it out.</b>

08:24.080 --> 08:25.330
<b>I-it's just...!</b>

08:25.330 --> 08:26.080
<b>Say it!</b>

08:26.630 --> 08:30.500
<b>You're petite, and your skin is soft...</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:33.250
<b>I was like, "Well, duh. She's a woman."</b>

08:34.630 --> 08:38.250
<b>Whenever guys say they want to protect a woman...</b>

08:39.040 --> 08:40.920
<b>I get why they feel that way.</b>

08:44.630 --> 08:46.330
<b>You're being unfair...</b>

08:54.210 --> 08:54.920
<b>Miss Ryu?</b>

08:55.420 --> 08:56.170
<b>Yes?</b>

08:57.830 --> 09:00.290
<b>What do you want to do when you get home?</b>

09:04.130 --> 09:08.080
<b>I want to eat one of Mama Mia's warm, homemade meals.</b>

09:08.830 --> 09:11.330
<b>Me, too. We should go to the tavern together.</b>

09:11.630 --> 09:16.170
<b>But I'm sure Syr and the others are going
to yell at me before I get a chance.</b>

09:16.670 --> 09:19.080
<b>"How could you be so careless?" and all that...</b>

09:19.790 --> 09:20.710
<b>You're probably right.</b>

09:20.710 --> 09:21.630
<b>What about you?</b>

09:22.040 --> 09:26.540
<b>Welf, Lili, Miss Mikoto, Miss Haruhime...</b>

09:27.420 --> 09:31.380
<b>I want to walk home with them, to see Goddess Hestia.</b>

09:32.080 --> 09:33.250
<b>To tell her, "I'm back."</b>

09:33.250 --> 09:37.500
<b>Yeah, that sounds nice... Be sure to cherish your Familia.</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:40.130
<b>I will. Just like you.</b>

09:40.580 --> 09:42.000
<b>They'll always be special to me.</b>

09:42.880 --> 09:43.830
<b>Thank you...</b>

09:50.790 --> 09:52.540
<b>How's your leg?</b>

09:53.420 --> 09:54.460
<b>Let's see here...</b>

09:55.210 --> 10:01.420
<b>The bones are slightly misaligned, but...
at the very least, I should be able to walk on my own.</b>

10:01.830 --> 10:03.330
<b>Are you feeling alright, Bell?</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:04.080
<b>Sure am!</b>

10:04.290 --> 10:06.170
<b>I've gotten most of my strength back.</b>

10:09.170 --> 10:12.880
<b>In all likelihood, this is the only "oasis" on the 37th Floor.</b>

10:13.330 --> 10:16.710
<b>If we wanted to, we could stay here
and rest for as long as we like.</b>

10:17.250 --> 10:19.710
<b>The problem is, there's no food supply.</b>

10:20.250 --> 10:21.040
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:21.460 --> 10:22.170
<b>Besides...</b>

10:22.630 --> 10:25.000
<b>I've done everything in my power
to try and mend your left arm,</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:29.330
<b>but you won't be making a full recovery
until we reach the surface.</b>

10:29.920 --> 10:30.630
<b>Right...</b>

10:31.420 --> 10:35.460
<b>The Dungeon doesn't allow those who choose
to languish in its depths return home alive.</b>

10:36.170 --> 10:38.380
<b>Whenever you're ready, we should get going.</b>

10:38.710 --> 10:39.790
<b>Sounds like a plan...</b>

10:43.000 --> 10:46.170
<b>That peaceful moment was just a one-time thing.</b>

10:47.540 --> 10:49.040
<b>My mind is playing tricks on me.</b>

10:50.750 --> 10:51.540
<b>Let's move.</b>

10:52.460 --> 10:53.420
<b>Roger!</b>

10:59.750 --> 11:02.880
<b>So does that mean we're standing
in "uncharted territory"?</b>

11:03.630 --> 11:08.790
<b>In the sense that it's never been recorded on a map, yes.</b>

11:09.290 --> 11:12.960
<b>However, something about this place seems peculiar...</b>

11:13.670 --> 11:16.460
<b>I've never seen flowers like those before, either.</b>

11:17.540 --> 11:20.750
<b>They don't look like anything in
the Dungeon field guide I read at the Guild...</b>

11:21.460 --> 11:25.460
<b>Perhaps they're the only vegetation
that grows in the White Palace.</b>

11:29.040 --> 11:30.460
<b>Bell, come smell these.</b>

11:30.460 --> 11:31.500
<b>Uh, okay.</b>

11:35.790 --> 11:37.080
<b>It smells sweet!</b>

11:37.540 --> 11:41.290
<b>It's not much, I know. But did it make you feel any better?</b>

11:41.630 --> 11:44.330
<b>Yeah! Thanks a lot, Miss Ryu!</b>

11:57.750 --> 11:59.250
<b>A dead end...</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:02.670
<b>Maybe we shouldn't have come this way, after all...</b>

12:07.830 --> 12:08.830
<b>Look up there.</b>

12:09.500 --> 12:12.380
<b>Those rocks... Their composition is different.</b>

12:36.420 --> 12:38.080
<b>We're on the 37th Floor.</b>

12:38.790 --> 12:41.290
<b>Miss Ryu, down there...</b>

12:42.460 --> 12:44.080
<b>I sense it, too. There are monsters nearby.</b>

12:44.670 --> 12:48.960
<b>We're back, aren't we? In the real Dungeon...</b>

12:57.710 --> 12:59.790
<b>We still haven't seen any monsters...</b>

13:00.500 --> 13:03.080
<b>I must admit, the silence is rather eerie...</b>

13:03.920 --> 13:06.830
<b>But let's enjoy it while it lasts. Stay on your toes.</b>

13:06.830 --> 13:07.500
<b>Roger.</b>

13:22.460 --> 13:24.420
<b>Miss Ryu, am I imagining things, or is that...?</b>

13:25.250 --> 13:27.580
<b>Yes... One of the Great Rings.</b>

13:28.130 --> 13:31.580
<b>This path... It's the normal route. I'm certain of it.</b>

13:32.710 --> 13:37.460
<b>The wall is an ashen gray...
Which means this is the Fourth Ring.</b>

13:38.130 --> 13:40.630
<b>So, if we can make it past that wall, then...?</b>

13:40.920 --> 13:48.040
<b>All that's left is the Fifth Wall. And once we cross that,
it's a straight shot to the 36th Floor's adjoining tunnel.</b>

13:48.630 --> 13:49.500
<b>Let's keep going!</b>

13:50.130 --> 13:51.170
<b>Right.</b>

13:52.170 --> 13:55.210
<b>Finally... Luck's on our side.</b>

13:55.960 --> 13:56.920
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

13:58.040 --> 14:01.460
<b>We kept pushing, we kept fighting,
and our hard work paid off.</b>

14:25.080 --> 14:27.710
<b>We can make it home... And we will.</b>

14:28.380 --> 14:31.130
<b>To the surface... To all our friends.</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:33.420
<b>Both me and Miss Ryu.</b>

14:37.380 --> 14:38.130
<b>Do you feel that?</b>

14:38.540 --> 14:41.460
<b>Yeah... Something's not right.</b>

14:46.790 --> 14:51.170
<b>I don't see any monsters... But I can sense it.</b>

14:51.920 --> 14:53.670
<b>A bloodthirsty malevolence closing in on us...</b>

15:12.880 --> 15:15.000
<b>The Juggernaut...</b>

15:18.380 --> 15:20.290
<b>Was it waiting for us?</b>

15:21.130 --> 15:22.130
<b>Here?</b>

15:24.920 --> 15:27.580
<b>At the very last obstacle keeping us from the 36th Floor?</b>

15:30.040 --> 15:32.040
<b>It's got a right arm...?!</b>

15:33.250 --> 15:36.630
<b>But I... I'm positive I sliced it off the last time I fought it!</b>

15:39.920 --> 15:42.040
<b>What IS that...?</b>

15:43.710 --> 15:44.960
<b>A Skull Sheep?!</b>

15:46.170 --> 15:46.880
<b>It can't be...</b>

15:46.880 --> 15:48.880
<b>Did it EAT another monster?!</b>

15:51.790 --> 15:54.330
<b>But that's not possible... There's no way...</b>

16:04.580 --> 16:06.130
<b>Not just a Skull Sheep...</b>

16:06.500 --> 16:08.710
<b>That looks like the flesh of a Barbarian!</b>

16:09.420 --> 16:10.330
<b>And those are...</b>

16:12.330 --> 16:13.670
<b>the bones of a Spartoi!</b>

16:16.080 --> 16:18.170
<b>The rest of its tail grew back, too...</b>

16:18.750 --> 16:21.630
<b>Those look like Lizardman scales on the outside!</b>

16:26.460 --> 16:30.540
<b>It ate a bunch of different monsters and...
fused them with its body!</b>

16:32.250 --> 16:34.790
<b>Almost like some sort of... chimera!</b>

16:38.500 --> 16:41.130
<b>It's slower than before... I can follow its movements!</b>

16:41.420 --> 16:44.420
<b>Don't panic. At this rate, I can take it down-</b>

16:48.080 --> 16:48.880
<b>Spikes...?!</b>

16:48.880 --> 16:50.500
<b>It can attack like a Skull Sheep, too?!</b>

16:57.000 --> 16:59.880
<b>It's compensating for its slower speed
with these new abilities!</b>

17:05.290 --> 17:06.710
<b>My body's frozen...</b>

17:07.130 --> 17:10.290
<b>"Disaster" personified... A nightmare come to life...</b>

17:11.330 --> 17:15.170
<b>But I can't give up... I don't want to lose him!</b>

17:16.330 --> 17:17.330
<b>Anyone but Bell...!</b>

17:23.290 --> 17:24.290
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

17:34.040 --> 17:39.330
<b>Impossible... That attack belongs
to the Floor Boss, Udaeus!</b>

17:42.420 --> 17:43.210
<b>Bell!</b>

17:52.080 --> 17:53.540
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

18:31.960 --> 18:32.920
<b>More monsters...</b>

18:33.460 --> 18:35.080
<b>But it's the only choice we've got!</b>

18:49.460 --> 18:50.750
<b>We're out of range!</b>

19:07.290 --> 19:09.000
<b>I'll use my healing magic...</b>

19:18.500 --> 19:21.290
<b>It's too late... We're done for.</b>

19:22.330 --> 19:26.040
<b>Bell and I have both lost too much blood...</b>

19:28.580 --> 19:33.670
<b>We may have survived for this long, but it's all over now...</b>

19:37.210 --> 19:37.920
<b>Bell!</b>

19:39.250 --> 19:40.580
<b>Miss Ryu...?</b>

19:41.250 --> 19:45.040
<b>It's me... I'm right here.</b>

19:46.960 --> 19:49.250
<b>And the Juggernaut...?</b>

19:49.710 --> 19:54.580
<b>It's gone. It left us alone.</b>

19:55.420 --> 19:59.130
<b>So you don't need to worry anymore...</b>

20:00.580 --> 20:05.210
<b>I guess it must've given up on catching us...</b>

20:05.580 --> 20:06.290
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:11.080
<b>Now we can go home, right? The both of us.</b>

20:12.080 --> 20:14.880
<b>Back to Miss Syr and the others...</b>

20:15.380 --> 20:19.380
<b>That's right... We're going home.</b>

20:22.250 --> 20:23.170
<b>Bell...</b>

20:24.420 --> 20:25.130
<b>Yeah?</b>

20:26.170 --> 20:28.830
<b>Can you hold me, one last time?</b>

20:46.210 --> 20:47.330
<b>So warm...</b>

20:49.670 --> 20:54.630
<b>I feel closer to him than anyone else in the world...
at least for right now.</b>

20:56.710 --> 21:03.330
<b>Who would have thought the final moments
of a fruitless death... could be so sweet...?</b>

21:09.420 --> 21:13.670
<b>Bell... I'm going to rest my eyes for a bit.</b>

21:14.290 --> 21:17.380
<b>Okay. I'll wake you up in a little while.</b>

21:23.250 --> 21:24.790
<b>It's for the best.</b>

21:25.040 --> 21:28.500
<b>Poor Miss Ryu... She's already been through so much.</b>

21:29.750 --> 21:32.080
<b>Please, let her have sweet dreams...</b>

21:33.500 --> 21:34.960
<b>At least until it's all over.</b>

21:39.750 --> 21:43.460
<b>It hurts... My entire body is screaming in pain.</b>

21:43.830 --> 21:44.750
<b>But...</b>

21:45.710 --> 21:49.380
<b>As long as I can feel the pain... I can move!</b>

21:59.750 --> 22:03.920
<b>Just you wait, 'cause I WILL protect her!</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:41.830
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:41.830
<b>Luvia</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:41.830
<b>Starry Flower</b>

23:38.000 --> 23:40.290
<b>Next time: "Luvia."</b>
